<title>LATVIA: POLIGRAFIST, CENTRS OFFERS COMPLETED.</title>
<headline>POLIGRAFIST, CENTRS OFFERS COMPLETED.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The public offers of shares in companies Poligrafists and shopping centre Universalveikals Centrs have been completed with Polgrafists sold for 8.91 lats and Centrs for 9.55 lats, the bourse said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the Poligrafist sale used 27,774 privatisation certificates and the Centrs sale used 176,706 certificates. All the offered shares were sold.</p>
<p>The results still have to confirmed by the privatisation agency.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
